### Portal用户管理API测试文件

###
# 注意: 请先确保organization-service服务已启动 (默认端口: 8800)
# 在测试前，请先获取有效的access_token

### 1. 获取当前用户信息 (重构后的接口)
GET http://localhost:8800/users/current
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 获取用户岗位列表
GET http://localhost:8800/users/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 获取当前用户菜单权限
GET http://localhost:8800/users/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 切换用户当前岗位
POST http://localhost:8800/users/switch-position
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "positionId": 1
}

### 5. 获取用户个性化配置
GET http://localhost:8800/users/personal-config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. 更新用户个性化配置
PUT http://localhost:8800/users/personal-config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaultPositionId": 1,
  "theme": "dark",
  "language": "zh_CN",
  "menuCollapsed": false,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "preferences": {
    "autoSave": true,
    "notifications": true
  }
}

### 7. 创建用户个性化配置
POST http://localhost:8800/users/personal-config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "defaultPositionId": 1,
  "theme": "light",
  "language": "zh_CN",
  "menuCollapsed": false,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "preferences": {
    "autoSave": false,
    "notifications": true,
    "darkMode": false
  }
}

### 8. 删除用户个性化配置
DELETE http://localhost:8800/users/personal-config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ==========================================
### 测试说明
### ==========================================

### 测试步骤:
### 1. 首先确保服务已启动
### 2. 通过Portal登录接口获取access_token
### 3. 替换上方{{access_token}}为实际token
### 4. 按顺序执行测试用例

### 预期结果:
### 1. /current: 返回完整的PortalUser对象，包含员工信息、岗位列表、菜单权限等
### 2. /positions: 返回用户的所有岗位信息
### 3. /menus: 返回当前岗位的菜单权限树
### 4. /switch-position: 切换岗位成功，返回更新后的用户信息
### 5. /personal-config: CRUD操作用户个性化配置

### 注意事项:
### - 确保数据库中有对应的测试数据
### - 用户必须已认证并拥有有效token
### - 岗位ID和配置值需要根据实际数据调整 